body:
So there isn't much we can do about the necessity of setting `MAVEN_OPTS="--enable-preview"`.

Since Quarkus does a lot of stuff at build time and some extensions might need to load classes from the build classpath, the process that runs the build (which is the Maven process), needs to have the flag `--enable-preview` enabled.

@gsmet Perhaps that is something we need to add to one of the guides?
